### Test 1: Save Maker - New maker
POST {{baseUrl}}/Vehicle/saveMaker
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "makerName": "Foton"
}

### Test 2: Save Maker - Existing maker (idempotent, created = false)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Vehicle/saveMaker
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "makerName": "FOTON"
}

### Test 3: Save Maker - Invalid (empty name)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Vehicle/saveMaker
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "makerName": ""
}
